---
title: "Page not found · VORNAC"
description: "The page you are looking for does not exist or has moved."
ogType: website
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{# Custom 404 — Vercel serves dist/404.html for unmatched routes. Extends the
   base layout so analytics (incl. the Google tag) still run: a stale ad URL
   landing here keeps its gclid and the visitor keeps the site navigation.
   No i18nKey on purpose: counterpart stays null, so no language redirect. #}
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block content %}
<main class="relative z-10 py-24 lg:py-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 text-center">
        <p class="font-mono text-sm tracking-widest text-amber-600">404</p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold">Page not found</h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-stone-500">
            The page you are looking for does not exist or has moved.
            Seite nicht gefunden &mdash; sie existiert nicht oder wurde verschoben.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-10 flex items-center justify-center gap-6">
            <a href="/" class="rounded-full bg-amber-500 px-6 py-2.5 font-semibold text-stone-900 transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-amber-400">Homepage</a>
            <a href="/de" class="font-semibold text-stone-600 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-stone-900">Deutsche Startseite</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>
{% endblock %}
